        "notes": {
          "after": "Review the generic bovine albumin ingredient at NCIT:C85253. FDA qualifies CAS 9048-46-8 as GENERIC (FAMILY). Retain source Sigma A7030 and other recipe-specific fraction V/products as supplied forms, not exact synonyms. Preserve all seven original recipe memberships and their preparation qualifiers.\n\nSource-scoped proposal w05::MATERIALS-C1193-albumin-forms: Extend source-specific bovine-albumin preparation provenance on the existing generic BSA owner. Fraction V is recorded only where literal; the unnumbered fraction in M2400/M2401 remains unnumbered. No generic exact synonym, catalog, stock volume or albumin-origin reinterpretation is added. Source-qualified proposal under issue1193. No ingredient roles, assay outcomes, complete-owner support or release admission are approved. Preserve all frozen source and owner holds; component uncertainty is stated separately from whole-material identity.\n\nSource-scoped proposal w10::sv1-bio-bsa_source_supplied_forms: Extend only source-scoped supplied-form provenance on the established NCITC85253 albumin owner. Miles81-003 is explicitly named; generic fractionV inputs in JCM220 and ADC stocks are retained without a unique purification method or inferred concentration basis. ExistingA9647/A7409 and all prior holds remain unchanged. Source labels retained as nonresolving provenance: [{\"case_id\": \"CM_NAME:05cf4675ae38ae4637b1d61cd8b2d7378b8c29edcdd55d893c13b13636ee537e\", \"raw_label\": \"bovine serum albumin, FractionV (Miles Laboratories, Elkhart, IN, No.81-003)\"}, {\"case_id\": \"CM_NAME:253a79dd170899976bf0b3d8c12d609bc158a0e8fa004e74eee9a853abe462bc\", \"raw_label\": \"Bovine serum albumin, fraction V\"}, {\"case_id\": \"CM_NAME:3a54b7655eda168bfefd6b9ada1bc493af9b21485054715ecb4181566ae9ae11\", \"raw_label\": \"Bovine Serum Albumin, Frac V\"}, {\"case_id\": \"CM_NAME:6b489e5bdcb9e5c78a1c92f937bdcb5eb3f770e52865b1319d3448a101f48904\", \"raw_label\": \"bovine serum albumine, fract. V (important: Sigma No A9647)\"}]. No global generic alias, supplier equivalence, role approval or complete publication approval is conferred. Receiving-medium dose and unit repairs remain separate. Existing native holds and rejected labels are preserved. The exact frozen target is the BSA fraction V constituent at solutions/2/composition/0, inside the separately represented 20% stock. JCM220 specifies that the BSA solution is separately filter-sterilized before aseptic addition. This proposal associates the constituent only, not the complete nominal 20% stock; no percentage basis or solvent is inferred.",
          "before": "Review the generic bovine albumin ingredient at NCIT:C85253. FDA qualifies CAS 9048-46-8 as GENERIC (FAMILY). Retain source Sigma A7030 and other recipe-specific fraction V/products as supplied forms, not exact synonyms. Preserve all seven original recipe memberships and their preparation qualifiers."
        },
