nthetical taxon; that parenthetical is not adopted. No ultrafiltered supplement or Soytone equivalence.\", \"source\": \"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/ontologies/micro/terms?iri=http%3A%2F%2Fpurl.obolibrary.org%2Fobo%2FMICRO_0001795\"}], \"mapping_quality\": \"EXACT_MATCH\", \"ontology_id\": \"MICRO:0001795\", \"ontology_label\": \"Phytone peptone\", \"ontology_source\": \"MICRO\"}}\n\nCurrent scope: specific Phytone peptone under MICRO:0001795 on the authentic original MediaDive362 owner. Both MediaDive125 and TOGO M2989 source contexts are retained. RAW_TEXT is resolving under native policy: the three retained Phytone source spellings are intentional product-scoped names, not nonresolving placeholders. No UF/Soytone equality, barley identity, SKU, precise recipe, role or transfer of the old shared-ID 1089/833 counts is approved. Counts remain historical and unchanged; all source occurrences need their own scoped routing. The three false Phytone claims on Soy_Peptone are corrected in the coupled candidate. https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1212#issuecomment-6718503130",
