      "issue_conclusions": {
        "phytone": {
          "body": "The Phytone identity question is sufficiently supported for a bounded correction: retain the authentic Phytone record and use specific **MICRO:0001795, Phytone peptone**. The official term identifies the BBL/Difco trademark and cites the manufacturer definition; TOGO M2989 explicitly names the BBL product. The manufacturer's guide distinguishes this product from Phytone UF, Soytone and other soy products. The erroneous `Hordeum vulgare` parenthetical in ontology annotation is a known limitation, not evidence that this product is barley-derived.\n\nCouple this with source-preserving nonresolving dispositions for three tokens on Soy_Peptone: `Phytone peptone`, `Phytone peptone (BD-BBL)`, and `Soytone (BD-Difco) or Phytone peptone (BD-BBL)`. The third expresses alternatives. Do not merge owners, copy shared-ID occurrence memberships, or treat export suppression alone as a repair of false exact synonyms. Other Soy/Corn claims remain within their own review scope.\n\nSources: [official MicrO term](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/ontologies/micro/terms?obo_id=MICRO:0001795), [TOGO M2989](https://togomedium.org/medium/M2989), [manufacturer guide](https://documents.thermofisher.com/TFS-Assets/BPD/brochures/peptones-supplements-feeds-technical-reference-guide.pdf).\n\nIndependent full-owner scope review is recorded in `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/existing-owner-scope-decisions-v1/`; decisions SHA256 `150af7315aa6688d4bc9adb3e2a27d0a0835ec8f8ac33d65b8951712b0382d81`, manifest `c664e35067692c0aa46c4570ec688ffba9281e692337cfa5de1e4f014dc2ce54`. The coordinator rehashed all 89 manifest members. This is a sourced conclusion for candidate preparation; final exact candidate bytes still require native validation and independent review. No maintained records or approvals have changed.\n",
          "id": 6718503130,
          "path": "/Users/marcin/Documents/VIMSS/ontology/Mechs/MediaIngredientMech/.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/root-integration-findings-v1/issue1212-scope-conclusion-readback-v1.json",
          "sha256": "c9f5aa36150caa8cefa72b191eaeb449b4eab83f1f55694778cc7c27943aa512",
          "url": "https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1212#issuecomment-6718503130"
        }
      },
