                "evidence_type": "CURATOR_JUDGMENT",
                "notes": "Historical unsupported assertion, contradicted by supplier evidence; not current support. Original rationale: Commercial food mixture - FOODON is correct parent ontology. Polypeptone (BD/Difco) is a blend of casein and meat peptones; Hipolypepton (Nihon seiyaku/Wako) is a similar Japanese peptone blend of casein + soy. Mapped to FOODON parent 'protein hydrolyzates' since no exact FOODON term exists. CLOSE_MATCH.",
