              "changes": "Added 'Peptic digest of soybean meal' as a EXACT_SYNONYM (#260): the USP/compendial descriptor for soy peptone — the same product the record already lists as `Soybean peptone`, `Peptone from soymeal`, `Soytone` and `Phytone peptone`. Names the manufacturing process rather than a different substance. CultureMech uses this surface form and label_index did not contain it, so the lookup missed. No new record: FOODON:03315720 is this record's identifier, and in MIM the identifier IS the ontology CURIE, so a second record on it would be a duplicate primary key rather than added coverage.",
              "curator": "add_culturemech_gap_labels",
              "llm_assisted": false,
