        },
        "notes": {
          "after": "Imported from mim-queue (source_id=mediadive.ingredient:2375); no CAS-RN or CHEBI/NCIT match. Reviewed on 2026-05-11 as an animal-derived bile preparation pending source-backed composition curation. Issue1201 successor scope: The source ingredient is desiccated ox bile, a dried bovine bile material. NBRC1004 and NBRC1390 independently name desiccated ox bile as a weighed dry ingredient; Sigma70168 confirms the material is produced by dehydrating fresh ox bile. This is neither fresh liquid bile nor an isolated bile salt, and no supplier-specific grade or constituent concentration is asserted. Generic ox-bile owners and Oxgall are recorded reconciliation candidates, not automatically merged or equated to this explicitly dried material.",
          "before": "Imported from mim-queue (source_id=mediadive.ingredient:2375); no CAS-RN or CHEBI/NCIT match. Reviewed on 2026-05-11 as an animal-derived bile preparation pending source-backed composition curation."
