        "notes": {
          "after": "Imported from mim-queue (source_id=mediadive.ingredient:2136); no CAS-RN or CHEBI/NCIT match. Reviewed on 2026-05-11 as a named complex nutrient powder pending product-specific composition curation.\n\nSource-scoped proposal w01::KG26-PROP-182-IDENTITY: Oxoid Lab-Lemco is a refined meat-extract powder, identified by original DSMZ727 and CCAP CHM/EG/EG:JM formulations and current official LP0029 specification. This whole variable-composition product is not one molecule or a finished medium. The exact molecular constituent list and historical lot composition are not established and are not required to preserve the named product identity. Current supplier compositional ranges are not backdated to historical lots.\n\nSource-scoped proposal w05::CHEM-C1193-Lab-Lemco: Correction1193: Oxoid Lab-Lemco powder LP0029 is a named refined meat-extract product. Primary specification and catalogue corroborate product identity; composition varies and no fixed molecular formula or complete component quantities are asserted. This does not identify Lab-Lemco Broth or generic beef extract as this product. Historical owner aliases and counts retained.",
