        "notes": {
          "after": "Imported from microbedecoder (source_id=kgmicrobe.compound:pyg_rumen_fluid); no CAS-RN or CHEBI/NCIT match. Curator review needed.\n\nHistorical dependency-only proposal is retained in curation history and the immutable trace; it is superseded because relinking would preserve an unsupported clarification claim. Current #1204/#204 correction: the source label supports literal rumen fluid, not clarified rumen fluid or a cow/JCM/DSMZ preparation. The processing claim and both the former MICRO0000520 link and proposed local clarified-fluid retarget are superseded. Preserve the named part as UNMAPPED without a component_id; no generic UBERON grounding or preparation guess is approved. Source-specific processing and whole-parent support remain withheld. Other parts, quantities, roles and completeness values are unchanged and not newly endorsed. https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1204#issuecomment-6718503591",
          "before": "Imported from microbedecoder (source_id=kgmicrobe.compound:pyg_rumen_fluid); no CAS-RN or CHEBI/NCIT match. Curator review needed."
